  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.ChainflipOASIS v2.0.4\n\nConnects the OASIS to Chainflip -- the native cross-chain swap protocol enabling non-custodial swaps between major assets without wrapped tokens or bridges. OASIS avatars can execute atomic cross-chain swaps via the Chainflip AMM. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.3\n- Implement Chainflip CQL source and verified historical swap walkthrough (363af9a)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Blockchain/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.ChainflipOASIS",
